---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Home" description="Automatic hazard lights for your Moto Guzzi. You decide when to switch them on.">
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
<div class="made-in-france">
  <div class="made-in-france-text">
    THE HEART OF THE KIT<br />
    IS MADE IN FRANCE
  </div>
  <div class="french-flag"></div>
 <img class="france-map" src="/images/france.svg" alt="Map of France" />
</div>

      <div class="hero-copy"><h1>Automatic hazard lights.<br />Made simple.</h1><div class="red-rule"></div><h2>You decide.<br />Weasy Rider takes care of the rest.</h2><p>Switch on the hazard lights manually. They pause while a turn signal is on and resume automatically when you cancel it. You stay in control throughout.</p><p class="warranty-note">Your motorcycle’s original wiring stays intact, preserving the manufacturer’s warranty.</p><div class="compatible">Compatible with <b><span class="compatible-models"><span>V100 Mandello</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>V100 Stelvio</span></span> <span class="compatible-v7">V7 (in development)</span></b></div><a class="order-button" href="/en/contact/#haut-de-page">Order my kit</a></div>
    </section>
    <section class="benefits" aria-label="Weasy Rider benefits">
      <div class="benefits-list">
        <h2 class="benefits-title">The magic of the Weasy Rider kit</h2>
        <article class="benefit"><div class="benefit-icon">☝</div><h3>Manual activation</h3><div class="red-rule"></div><p>You decide when to switch on the hazard lights.</p></article>
        <article class="benefit"><div class="benefit-icon">↔</div><h3>Automatic operation</h3><div class="red-rule"></div><p>The hazard lights pause while a turn signal is on and resume when you cancel it.</p></article>
        <article class="benefit"><div class="benefit-icon">♢</div><h3>Stay in control</h3><div class="red-rule"></div><p>You stay in control at all times.</p></article>
      </div>
      <div class="product-promo"><div class="product-promo-photo"><div class="warning-image">
          <img src="/images/tableau-de-bord-v100.webp" alt="Moto Guzzi V100 Mandello dashboard" width="1024" height="683" />
          <div class="warning-demo" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 4 21 20H3Z M12 9v5 M12 16v1" /></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="warning-controls" role="group" aria-label="Turn signal controls">
            <button type="button" data-direction aria-label="Left turn signal">←</button>
            <button type="button" data-reset aria-label="Cancel turn signal">●</button>
            <button type="button" data-direction aria-label="Right turn signal">→</button>
          </div>
          <div class="warning-controls-pointer" aria-hidden="true">↑</div><div class="warning-test-callout" aria-hidden="true">Try it here<span>↓</span><span>↓</span><span class="warning-test-diagonal">↓</span></div>
          </div><p class="warning-help" aria-live="polite"><strong class="warning-click">Click</strong> ← or →, then quickly click ●.</p>
        </div><div class="product-promo-copy"><div><h3>An LED indicator<br />discreet and effective</h3><div class="red-rule"></div><p>The hazard light indicator sits in the fairing facing the rider, where it is easy to see without obstructing the view.</p><div class="red-rule"></div><p>Easy to see without distraction.</p></div><div><h3>A complete kit designed for your Moto Guzzi</h3><ul><li>Electronic module</li><li>Model-specific wiring harness</li><li>Compatible connectors</li><li>Installation instructions</li></ul><a href="/en/produits/">Explore the kit　→</a></div></div></div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>


<style>
  .warranty-note {
    color: #ff5959;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .warranty-note {
      animation: warranty-blink 1.5s ease-in-out 10;
    }
  }

  @keyframes warranty-blink {
    50% {
      opacity: 0.55;
    }
  }
</style>
<script>
  for (const demo of document.querySelectorAll('.product-promo-photo')) {
    const lamp = demo.querySelector('.warning-demo');
    const help = demo.querySelector('.warning-help');
    let lastDirection = -Infinity;
    let active = false;
    let timeout = 0;
    const gestureWindow = 1000;

    for (const direction of demo.querySelectorAll('[data-direction]')) {
      direction.addEventListener('click', () => {
        lastDirection = performance.now();
        clearTimeout(timeout);
        help.innerHTML = '<strong class="warning-click">Click</strong> ●.';
        timeout = window.setTimeout(() => {
          help.innerHTML = '<strong class="warning-click">Click</strong> ← or →, then quickly click ●.';
        }, gestureWindow);
      });
    }

    demo.querySelector('[data-reset]').addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (performance.now() - lastDirection > gestureWindow) return;
      lastDirection = -Infinity;
      clearTimeout(timeout);
      active = !active;
      lamp.classList.toggle('is-blinking', active);
      help.innerHTML = active ? 'Hazard lights on. Repeat the sequence to switch them off.' : 'Hazard lights off. <strong class="warning-click">Click</strong> ← or →, then click ●.';
    });
  }
</script>
